# 4. Enter Bundle ID (check in Xcode → Runner → Signing & Capabilities)
# 5. Download GoogleService-Info.plist
# 6. Place it in this directory (ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist)
# 7. Delete this placeholder file
#
# The file should be a valid Apple Property List XML
